From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Ahmed <mohamedahmedegypt2001@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 02:04:09 +0400
Subject: drm/nouveau/dispnv50: validate connector modes with IMP

Prune unsupported modes with isModePossible during connector probing,
using the same raster conversion as the head's atomic check.

Probe one unscaled head with primary RGB formats up to 32 bpp and no
overlay, so modes usable with compositor fallback remain available. This
isolates mode feasibility from other active heads, whose combined
resource use is checked at modeset time.

Signed-off-by: Mohamed Ahmed <mohamedahmedegypt2001@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 489f1a4f35d3aa12c2d67c10c3b86e1100c38da5)
---
